  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n (2 - ( frac{6)/(7) of 21 + 5.25 )}{(3)/(4) of (15.8 - 3.4 ) + 5 × 2.39}\n\n⇒ 2 – (6/7 × 21 + 5.25)/3/4 × (15.8 – 3.4) + 5 × 2.39\n\n⇒ 2 – (18 + 5.25)/3/4 × (15.8 – 3.4) + 5 × 2.39\n\n⇒ (2 – 23.25)/3/4 × (15.8 – 3.4) + 5 × 2.39\n\n⇒ -21.25/3/4 × (15.8 – 3.4) + 5 × 2.39\n\n⇒ -21.25/3/4 × 12.4 + 5 × 2.39\n\n⇒ -21.25/(3 × 3.1) + 5 × 2.39\n\n⇒ -21.25/(9.3 + 11.95)\n\n⇒ -21.25/21.25\n\n⇒ -1\n\n**∴ The required value is -1**",
